          "content": "## End-of-unit checklist\n\n- External forces and reactions identified on isolated body.\n\n- Dimensions, datums, load units and sign convention documented.\n\n- Vertical/horizontal resultant and moment balance checked separately.\n\n- Real-world limits and uncertainty recorded before any design interpretation."
